---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 pt-32 pb-24 text-left">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-10">Last updated: June 15, 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none
      prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:mt-10 prose-headings:mb-4
      prose-h2:text-xl
      prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-p:my-4
      prose-a:text-primary prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline
      prose-li:my-2">

      <h2>Introduction</h2>
      <p>
        Welcome to <strong>noureddinedriouech.me</strong> (the "Site"), the personal portfolio and blog of Noureddine DRIOUECH. This Privacy Policy explains how I collect, use, and protect your information when you visit my Site.
      </p>
      <p>
        I respect your privacy and am committed to protecting it. By using the Site, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy.
      </p>

      <h2>Information I Collect</h2>
      <h3>Automatically Collected Information</h3>
      <p>When you visit the Site, certain information is automatically collected, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Log Data:</strong> Your IP address, browser type, operating system, referring URLs, and pages visited.</li>
        <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> How you interact with the Site (clicks, scroll depth, time on page).</li>
        <li><strong>Device Data:</strong> Screen resolution, device type, and browser capabilities.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This information is used to analyze trends, administer the Site, and improve user experience.</p>

      <h3>Information You Provide Voluntarily</h3>
      <p>If you contact me via the contact form or email, I collect the information you provide (name, email address, message content). This information is used solely to respond to your inquiry.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
      <p>The Site uses cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your browsing experience and serve relevant advertisements.</p>

      <h3>What Are Cookies?</h3>
      <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device by your web browser. They help the Site remember your preferences and understand how you use the Site.</p>

      <h3>Cookies I Use</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> Required for the Site to function properly (e.g., theme preference storage).</li>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> Uses cookies to analyze site traffic and usage patterns. This data is anonymized where possible.</li>
        <li><strong>Google AdSense:</strong> Uses cookies to serve personalized advertisements based on your interests and browsing history.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>The Site uses the following third-party services:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> — Tracks and reports website traffic. <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Privacy Policy</a></li>
        <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong> — Displays contextual advertisements. <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Privacy Policy</a></li>
        <li><strong>Vercel</strong> — Hosting platform that collects standard server logs. <a href="https://vercel.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vercel's Privacy Policy</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Google AdSense</h2>
      <p>The Site uses Google AdSense to serve advertisements. Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this Site and other websites.</p>
      <p>You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Ad Settings</a>. You can also learn more about how Google uses data when you use partner sites at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>.</p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on your location, you may have the following rights regarding your personal data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of the data I hold about you.</li>
        <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request that I delete your data (where applicable).</li>
        <li><strong>Opt-Out:</strong> Opt out of cookies and personalized advertising via browser settings or Google's Ad Settings.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise these rights, contact me at <strong>nourddinedriouech@gmail.com</strong>.</p>

      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>I implement reasonable security measures to protect your information. However, no method of transmission over the Internet is completely secure, and I cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>The Site is not intended for children under the age of 16. I do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>I may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact me:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Email: <strong>nourddinedriouech@gmail.com</strong></li>
        <li>Website: <a href="https://noureddinedriouech.me">https://noureddinedriouech.me</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
